Files covered by this license:

    tur_agi_int8.h        species network, INT8 weights
    ikili_agi_int8.h      bird / not-bird network, INT8 weights
    rapor.txt             species network training report
    ikili_rapor.txt       binary network training report
    esik.txt              measured decision thresholds
    birlestirme.txt       measured window-voting table

WHY THIS DIRECTORY IS DIFFERENT

These networks were trained on three-second segments selected by BirdNET
Analyzer, using BirdNET's own predictions as a teacher signal. BirdNET is
released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, so a model distilled from it is plausibly a
derivative work and inherits the NonCommercial and ShareAlike terms. The
negative class is drawn from ESC-50, which is CC BY-NC 3.0 and also
NonCommercial. Rather than guess in the user's favour, this directory is
licensed to match the most restrictive input.

In practice: personal, educational and research use is fine. Commercial use of
these weights is not granted here. If you need a commercially usable model,
retrain from sources you have the rights to; the training pipeline in tools/
is MIT licensed and does not depend on these files.

